---
title: "flash_loan (Scallop Lend: Borrowing)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_pool: check asset_pool.available >= loan_amount
    q_check_pool --> q_error_liquidity: available < loan_amount
    q_check_pool --> q_issue: available >= loan_amount
    q_error_liquidity --> [*]: revert "insufficient liquidity"
    q_issue --> q_create_receipt: receipt = FlashLoanReceipt(coin_type, loan_amount, fee)
    q_create_receipt --> q_transfer: transfer(coin(loan_amount), borrower)
    q_transfer --> q_user_logic: borrower executes arbitrary logic within same tx
    q_user_logic --> q_repay: borrower calls repay_flash_loan(receipt, repay_coin)
    q_repay --> q_check_repay: repay_coin.amount >= loan_amount + fee
    q_check_repay --> q_error_repay: repay_coin.amount < loan_amount + fee
    q_check_repay --> q_finalize: repay_coin.amount >= loan_amount + fee
    q_error_repay --> [*]: revert "insufficient repayment"
    q_finalize --> q_collect_fee: protocol_income += fee
    q_collect_fee --> q_return_pool: asset_pool += loan_amount
    q_return_pool --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_create_receipt
        INV-001: fee = loan_amount * 0.001 (0.1% flash loan fee)
        INV-002: FlashLoanReceipt is a hot-potato object (must be consumed in same tx)
    end note

    note right of q_check_repay
        INV-003: Flash loan must be fully repaid + fee within same transaction
        INV-004: No collateral required for flash loans
        INV-005: Flash loan duration is 0 seconds from blockchain perspective
    end note

    note right of q_finalize
        INV-006: Pool balance after flash loan >= pool balance before flash loan
        INV-007: Fee is allocated entirely to protocol income
    end note
